# 📖 About

RxLauncher is a modern Minecraft Java Edition launcher designed for Android devices. It provides a smooth and optimized experience with support for multiple Minecraft versions, Fabric, Forge, NeoForge, custom Java runtimes, and advanced performance enhancements.

Built with performance, compatibility, and customization in mind.

---

# ✨ Features

- 🎮 Minecraft Java Edition
- ⚡ Optimized Performance
- 📱 Android Support
- 🌍 Microsoft Login
- 👤 Offline Login
- 🔐 Ely.by Login
- 🧩 Fabric Support
- 🔥 Forge Support
- ⚙️ NeoForge Support
- ☕ Java 8 / 17 / 21
- 📂 Separate Game Directories
- 🎨 Custom Themes
- 🖥 Landscape Mode
- 📺 Fullscreen Support
- 🎮 Custom Controls
- 📦 Mod Support
- 🖼 Resource Pack Support
- 🌄 Shader Support
- 📥 Automatic Downloads
- 🔄 Version Manager
- 📊 FPS Overlay
- 🔧 Runtime Manager

---

# 📱 Requirements

- Android 7.0+
- OpenGL ES 3.0+
- 4GB RAM Recommended
- Internet Connection

